# Realgam Tower (D4) final chapter for build/test_story_route
# (docs/realgam-story.md): world map -> 0x7B exterior -> Colosseum rounds ->
# tower -> final battles on 0x76 -> staff roll -> clear save -> Continue.
#   C3_ROUTE_PDA=<pda.c3pd> C3_ROUTE_STAFFROLL=<staffroll.c3v>
#     build/test_story_route <newgame dir> <boot dir>
#       <copy of pokemon-colosseum.24219.gci> tests/routes/realgam.route [report]
# Every expected flag is written by an original script; "clear" lines build
# the chapter checkpoint and "set" lines would be recorded shortcuts (none).
#
# Checkpoint. No supplied save sits between the Under lab (M4_labo_B1
# function 8 sets 0x45D, the world map's final-Realgam switch) and Realgam.
# Save 24219 (WES/RUI, 26:03, a natural playthrough) is past both, so every
# flag the final-chapter D4 banks write is cleared (0x7B, 0x67-0x76, 0x7C;
# D4_out 0x66 is the earlier Realgam visit and keeps its flags), with the
# staff roll's 0x478 and the eight Realgam Shadow snag flags the dome and
# tower banks branch on (0x84D + Shadow id: their first-time battles).
clear 0x45e 0x45f 0x461 0x463 0x464 0x465 0x466 0x467 0x468 0x46a 0x46b 0x46c 0x46d
clear 0x46f 0x471 0x473 0x474 0x475 0x476 0x477 0x478
clear 0x9c1 0x9c6 0x9e2 0x9e4 0x9e5 0x9e6 0x9e7 0x9ea 0x9eb 0x9ec 0x9fa
clear 0xa1b 0xa47 0xa48 0xa49 0xa4a 0xa4b 0xa5b 0xa5c 0xa5e 0xa5f 0xa63
clear 0xac9 0xacb 0xacc 0xaf1 0xaf9 0xb3f 0xdc4
clear 0x860 0x862 0x864 0x86f 0x870 0x871 0x872 0x873
