# The final colosseum's arrival (function 4) is the whole final event: six
# battles, the ending scenes, 0x476, then 5F(0x39F) to the staff roll. The
# staff roll offers the clear save (0x444C, Yes) and returns to the Outskirt
# Stand shop (floor 2, entrance 1) through fade script 05960008.
clearsave private/realgam/clear.gci
touch 2
expect 0x476 1
expect 0x478 1
expect_floor 0x02
# Title -> Continue: the written card reloads at the source checkpoint
# (2, previous 1, entrance 1) with the clear flag.
continue private/realgam/clear.gci
expect_floor 0x02
expect 0x478 1
